      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "<color=#FFC23D>\xBB</color>  <b>Runtime API:</b> AnimationFly.I.Play(new
    AnimationFlyRequest { Sprite or Prefab, Count, StartTransform, EndTransform,
    OnReward }).\n<color=#FFC23D>\xBB</color>  <b>Scene workflow:</b> [Demo] Services/Animation
    Fly holds the defaults (Spawn Parent = Fly Layer, Bonus Prefab List). Select
    a button to see its onClick wiring.\n<color=#FFC23D>\xBB</color>  <b>Verification:</b>
    Coins land in the wallet, gems in the gem counter; pause time and the flights
    still finish on unscaled time.\n<color=#FFC23D>\xBB</color>  Sliders write AnimationFly
    fields; Count goes into the request\n<color=#FFC23D>\xBB</color>  Pooled prefab:
    DisableAndPool reuses instances (watch OwnedVisualCount)\n<color=#FFC23D>\xBB</color> 
    Grant rewards in OnReward, not right after Play"
